        "title": "People Already Automating Elsewhere",
        "description": "Anyone currently using n8n, Zapier, Make, or similar for personal or business automation — especially someone already building in Twilite for other work, who would rather not maintain a second, disconnected tool for the automation half of what they do.",
        "needs": "Triggers, actions, and branching that are at least as capable as what they already use, expressed as graphs they can inspect, version, and edit the same way as everything else in Twilite.",
