          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# An n8n-Style Automation Template for Twilite\n\nA brainstorm for a workflow-automation node-class kit — triggers, actions, branching, data flowing along typed edges — on Twilite’s existing graph machinery instead of a separate automation product. First-pass reasoning, not a confirmed design: the biggest open fork is whether this means visual modeling only, or graphs that actually execute."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "ownsContent": true,
          "surfaceDelegation": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "n8n-style-automation-template"
